            ],
            [
                'q' => 'Can "then" start a sentence?',
                'a' => 'Yes: "Then we went home" is a common, correct construction showing sequence.',
            ],
            [
                'q' => 'Is this mistake common even among native speakers?',
                'a' => 'Yes, it\'s one of the most common typos in English, largely because the words sound similar when spoken quickly.',
