        'meta' => 'Complete list of all 2025 US federal holidays with exact dates, weekdays and the weekend-observance rule, including Thanksgiving and Memorial Day 2025.',
        'h1' => '2025 US Federal Holidays: Complete Calendar',
        'subtitle' => 'See every US federal holiday date for 2025, which day of the week it falls on, and which dates are officially observed due to weekends.',
        'article' => '<p>Below is the complete <strong>2025 federal holiday calendar</strong> for the United States, with all 11 official federal holidays, the day of the week each one falls on, and the observed date whenever a fixed holiday lands on a weekend. In 2025, 11 of the 11 federal holidays fall Monday–Friday and 0 fall on a Saturday or Sunday (with the federal weekend-observance rule applied where relevant).</p><h2>Full list of 2025 U.S. federal holidays</h2><table><tr><th>Date</th><th>Day</th><th>Holiday</th></tr><tr><td>01/01/2025</td><td>Wednesday</td><td>New Year\'s Day</td></tr><tr><td>01/20/2025</td><td>Monday</td><td>Martin Luther King Jr. Day</td></tr><tr><td>02/17/2025</td><td>Monday</td><td>Washington\'s Birthday (Presidents Day)</td></tr><tr><td>05/26/2025</td><td>Monday</td><td>Memorial Day</td></tr><tr><td>06/19/2025</td><td>Thursday</td><td>Juneteenth National Independence Day</td></tr><tr><td>07/04/2025</td><td>Friday</td><td>Independence Day</td></tr><tr><td>09/01/2025</td><td>Monday</td><td>Labor Day</td></tr><tr><td>10/13/2025</td><td>Monday</td><td>Columbus Day</td></tr><tr><td>11/11/2025</td><td>Tuesday</td><td>Veterans Day</td></tr><tr><td>11/27/2025</td><td>Thursday</td><td>Thanksgiving Day</td></tr><tr><td>12/25/2025</td><td>Thursday</td><td>Christmas Day</td></tr></table><h2>Federal weekend-observance rule</h2><p>When a fixed-date federal holiday (New Year\'s Day, Juneteenth, Independence Day, Veterans Day, Christmas Day) falls on a Saturday, it is observed the preceding Friday; if it falls on a Sunday, it is observed the following Monday, per the U.S. Office of Personnel Management (OPM) rule for federal employees. Holidays already tied to a specific weekday of the month — MLK Day, Presidents Day, Memorial Day, Labor Day, Columbus Day and Thanksgiving — never need this adjustment since they always land on a weekday.</p><h2>Thanksgiving and Memorial Day in 2025</h2><p>Thanksgiving 2025 falls on November 27, 2025, the fourth Thursday of November. Memorial Day 2025 falls on May 26, 2025, the last Monday of May.</p><h2>Federal holidays by month in 2025</h2><p>The 11 federal holidays of 2025 are distributed as follows: January (2), February (1), May (1), June (1), July (1), September (1), October (1), November (2), December (1). The busiest month is <strong>January</strong>, with 2 federal holidays.</p><p>Looking for another year? Try our <a href="/us-holiday-calculator/">U.S. federal holiday calculator</a>, which computes the full list — including Thanksgiving, Memorial Day, Labor Day and every other moving-date holiday — for any year you enter.</p>',
        'faq' => [
            ['q' => 'How many federal holidays are there in 2025?', 'a' => 'There are 11 federal holidays recognized by the US government in 2025.'],
            ['q' => 'When is Thanksgiving in 2025?', 'a' => 'Thanksgiving 2025 falls on November 27, 2025, the fourth Thursday of November.'],
            ['q' => 'When is Memorial Day in 2025?', 'a' => 'Memorial Day 2025 falls on May 26, 2025, the last Monday of May.'],
            ['q' => 'Do federal holidays shift when they fall on a weekend?', 'a' => 'Yes — fixed-date federal holidays (New Year\'s Day, Juneteenth, Independence Day, Veterans Day, Christmas) are observed the preceding Friday if they fall on a Saturday, or the following Monday if they fall on a Sunday.'],
        ],
    ],
],
