            ['q' => 'Why does the rule use crop factor instead of just the lens\'s focal length?', 'a' => 'Because what matters for visible shake in the photo is the effective (full-frame-equivalent) focal length, since smaller sensors magnify the effect of any hand shake more in the final image.'],
        ],
    ],
