                'q' => 'Is daylight saving time considered?',
                'a' => 'Yes, at both departure and arrival, using each city\'s official time zone on the chosen date.',
            ],
            [
                'q' => 'Why can the arrival fall on a different day?',
                'a' => 'Because the destination\'s local clock can be many hours ahead of or behind the origin. The day line shows +1, 0 or −1 relative to the departure day.',
            ],
            [
                'q' => 'Can I use it for connecting flights?',
                'a' => 'Yes: enter the total travel time (flights plus layovers) as the duration, or calculate each leg separately.',
            ],
        ],
