            [
                'q' => 'How many cycles should I sleep?',
                'a' => 'For most adults, 5 to 6 cycles (7 h 30 min to 9 h) come close to the recommended 7 to 9 hours. Some people feel fine with a bit less or more.',
            ],
            [
                'q' => 'Do I need to add the time it takes to fall asleep?',
                'a' => 'Yes, and the calculator does it for you. Sleep onset time varies; 10 to 20 minutes is common, and you can adjust the field.',
